2:   dkt thickness Control   0.080 0.5374 2.8365   0.2286 0.2859       44          9     320        8       0.6162        0.3589             0.2801                  0.0833 -0.5500        8  0.3671
3:   dkt thickness Control   0.090 0.5459 2.6230   0.2616 0.2773       46         10     377        7       0.6013        0.3603             0.2724                  0.0774 -0.5909        9  0.4066
4:   dkt thickness Control   0.100 0.5823 2.5535   0.2798 0.2783       47         10     446        7       0.6003        0.3580             0.2717                  0.0809 -0.5859        9  0.4501
5:   dkt thickness Control   0.111 0.5474 2.5611   0.3047 0.2599       49         11     529        7       0.6020        0.3398             0.2482                  0.0642 -0.6667        9  0.4521

Sorry for the formatting. "max.comp" is the 9th column here and (as expected) increases as the graph density increases.

I hope this was helpful. If you would prefer to send me some data off-list, feel free to do so.

